<script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/interface/NewsvoteDWR.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="../../_dwr/engine.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/news/newscontent.js"></script><LINK href="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/photoswipe.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/photoswipe/3.0.5.1/pw.js"></script><script language="javascript" src="/system/resource/js/ajax.js"></script><form name="_newscontent_fromname">
<div style="min-height:300px;">
    <h1 align="center">西电开展第八届感恩中国近现代科学家奖助学金评选工作</h1>
    <div align="center" style="line-height:60px;color:#aaa;">时间：2025-11-26&nbsp;&nbsp;阅读次数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1370093333, 13284)</script>&nbsp;</div>
    <div id="vsb_content" style="line-height:24px;"><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_2 {  margin-top: 0.00pt;  margin-bottom: 0.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 24.00pt;  font-size: 24.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_3 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}table.docx_4 p {  text-align: justify;}table.docx_4 td {  border-top: 0.50pt solid black;  border-left: 0.50pt solid black;  border-bottom: 0.50pt solid black;  border-right: 0.50pt solid black;  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}span.docx_6 {  font-style: italic;}span.docx_7 {  color: #0000FF;  text-decoration: underline;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">为深化大学生爱国主义与科学精神教育，引导青年学子传承中国近现代科学家“崇尚科学、追求真理、艰苦奋斗、家国天下”的崇高品格，着力培养兼具社会责任感、创新精神与实践能力的新时代人才</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，我校于202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">年10-11月组织开展第</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">八</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">届感恩中国近现代科学家奖助学金评选工作。经个人申报、学院初审，32名学子脱颖而出进入校级评审环节，最终26名学子斩获殊荣。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">本次评选以“科学家精神引领成长”为核心导向，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">构建了包含</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">基础分、笔试分和</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">现场答辩三位一体的综合评审体系</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">，</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">全程凸显学子对科学家事迹与精神的深度考察。笔试环节聚焦中国近现代科学家光辉事迹、精神内核及校史校情，以考促学引导学生铭记科学先辈足迹。现场答辩</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">通过“PPT答辩+开放式必答题+评委提问”的多元形式，让候选人全方位展示学业成果、竞赛经历、科研实践及心得体会，评委重点考察学生对科学家精神的理解与认同，引导学子立足专业所长，深入思考如何以科技创新助力国家自立自强。</span><span id="_GoBack"></span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 311.8pt; height: 175.2pt;"><img src="/__local/7/95/7C/C2DAFAE8446343885704DFAC8C8_20591993_15AD3.jpeg" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/7957CC2DAFAE8446343885704DFAC8C8/20591993/15AD3" vheight=" 175.2pt" vwidth=" 311.8pt" orisrc="/__local/7/5F/1D/F0098A9A357C537CCCE2298F9C1_238CAD4B_149B7.jpeg" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 311.8pt; height: 175.2pt;"></span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 311.8pt; height: 241.05pt;"><img src="/__local/4/E8/69/D3AC7BC1E6B6C1DD1519CFF0DF7_84D72D7B_348FD.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/4E869D3AC7BC1E6B6C1DD1519CFF0DF7/84D72D7B/348FD" vheight=" 241.05pt" vwidth=" 311.8pt" orisrc="/__local/D/41/E4/FED666023193F2BFCD9CD89D0FF_BC2DB2B8_9B11B.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 311.8pt; height: 241.05pt;"></span></span></p><p style="text-indent: 0pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style=" position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 311.8pt; height: 220.45pt;"><img src="/__local/F/5F/CA/0CC0107C8E211E5FCFF4C93C40D_7F0EFBBA_3DA42.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F5FCA0CC0107C8E211E5FCFF4C93C40D/7F0EFBBA/3DA42" vheight=" 220.45pt" vwidth=" 311.8pt" orisrc="/__local/D/56/86/3EEC7393E30BB31260622E6C6BD_77218BB8_C9B35.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 311.8pt; height: 220.45pt;"></span></span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">经综合评分与排名，最终确定宋杨等10名同学为第八届感恩中国近现代科学家奖学金拟推荐人选，黄莉萍等16名同学为第八届感恩中国近现代科学家助学金拟推荐人选。此次评选不仅是对优秀学子的表彰与激励，更以榜样力量牵引广大青年学子厚植家国情怀、涵养科学精神，在钻研探索中追求卓越，在攻坚克难中敢于突破，努力成长为可堪时代重任的栋梁之才。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 24pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">据悉，</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">感恩中国近现代科学家奖助学金由西南交通大学与坚永公司于2018年共同设立，面向西部地区</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">及湖北武汉共34所</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 宋体; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;">“双一流”高校开展，旨在加强学生理想信念教育，引导广大学子弘扬爱国奋斗精神，投身科技事业，涵养开拓进取的创新精神，学习科学家、崇敬科学家、感恩科学家，去追科学家这颗最亮的“星”，让科学家精神，在新时代熠熠生辉！</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
